    {
      "id": 13,
      "title": "Current Resources Summary",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "**Current Resources Summary**\n\n**Total Containers CPU**: Sum of all container CPU usage\n**Total Containers Memory**: Sum of all container memory usage\n**Per-Service Breakdown**: Individual CPU and memory usage for each service\n\n**Services Monitored**:\n- **Application Services**: mastery-api, accounts-finder, mastery-worker\n- **Infrastructure**: postgres, grafana, prometheus, cadvisor, node-exporter, postgres-exporter, volume-metrics-exporter, load-balancer, redis\n\n**Data Source**: cAdvisor collects real-time metrics from Docker containers",
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 48},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "left"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "title": "Docker Volumes Monitoring",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "**Docker Volumes Monitoring**\n\nThis panel shows the actual size of your 3 Docker volumes:\n- **postgres_data**: PostgreSQL database files\n- **prometheus_data**: Prometheus metrics storage\n- **grafana_data**: Grafana dashboards and settings\n\n**Historical tracking**: You can see how these volumes grow over time as data accumulates.\n\n**Note**: These are the actual volumes used by your Docker containers, not system disk usage.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 52},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "left"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  
